how to market a new concept  so got a great email from one of my  newsletter subscribers love you guys  jerry who wrote in to say good morning  mr carmichael i recently came across  your postings on youtube and i've been  following  you ever since first let me thank you  for your work and your assistance the  entrepreneur community  thank you jerry as a person who has  failed in business many times i've  continued and pushed forward regardless  i don't waste your time but i have a  question and this may take a few minutes  of your time  i've been in the transportation  logistics field for over 10 years i've  expanded  and contracted a few times over the  years i've serviced retail clients such  as ashley furniture home depot sears and  a few others  but what i found is that most people or  delivery contractors don't have a steady  crew working with them  but the main issue is most can't find  help at a moment's notice  which sometimes in this business is  vital i have an idea to create an app  to help unskilled labor such as those in  constructions at carpentry  delivery services to link up with  available hands and workers  i need to know how would i market this  app i don't want to charge right off  because  i want to build the network of unskilled  labor first then as i get more exposure  maybe start charging fee to the  companies or business professionals who  need immediately help  this is sort of like a staffing agency  only i want instant results for those  who need help right away  how do i market this concept again i  love what you're doing keep up the great  work evan  jerry so jerry's a great question and  congratulations on  having the guts to go for and launch  your own business around this area  i wouldn't start with an app my number  one rule for you here  is start small number one is start small  don't start with an app  okay because an app is gonna cost you  money and what you need to do is test  this thing  is there actually a need for this so you  think there's a need is there actually  need will unskilled labor  give you their their contact information  and  then will the home depot or sears  whoever pay you  to make that service happen right and  you could start it without an  app start it just by getting people's  phone numbers and you can send text  messages to them  they're probably more likely to pay  attention to a text than to  an app anyway but you could start that  right now right you could start building  your list of unskilled laborers and say  hey  if you ever want to do delivery services  or whatever services  last minute i need people here's how  much approximately you're going to make  from it  give me your phone number and i'll text  you anytime i get a job  that's how you start and you build your  list and you ask them for friends  and you you start small you're testing  it you see if it works  okay don't go spending money on an app  that that you lose time on you're  investing your dollars into and you  don't know if it's gonna work or not  right and so many entrepreneurs go down  that road where they say here's my new  plan i'm gonna invest all these  all these dollars in time into creating  this thing and then it doesn't work out  where it's better to test it right away  on a small scale as quickly as you can  so that's my advice start off get their  phone numbers send texts  and it's manual but if it doesn't work  out  you're not dumping money into this thing  right if it doesn't work out it's just  a little bit of your time wasted number  two start local  start with a geographic area close to  you is going to be  easy and ideal and again we're testing  this thing out on a small scale  local workers okay you target the the  you know 10 local home depots and sears  and all that that are close to you  and the local workers who are all around  you and you start with them  you see if it works you see if you can  get them to sign up you see if you can  get them to  give you their their phone number so you  can send them text messages  that's going to be the easier side right  to get their information to say hey i  may have a job for you  send me your number and i can send you a  text when we have something  that should be the easier side it's then  can you deliver to  the home depot so home depot calls and  says hey yeah we need  three people to come and deliver this  thing can you actually  deliver and so you test local  test small you're to make some mistakes  you figure it out along the way  and then as you move up  number three is you prove the concept  right you're going to make mistakes  along the way  home depot is going to say you know you  didn't get me my people in time or  they're the wrong people or  they didn't do what i asked or they  didn't speak english or whatever the  criteria  is that they need right you're going to  make mistakes  but you're going to learn from them and  you're going to make it better and maybe  the solution  is going to be hey we need an app for  this maybe the solution is that the  unskilled workers  they would love an app and maybe the  home depot guys would love to be able to  log in and just  press a few buttons and have some  workers show up  right maybe that's the end solution but  you're not going to know that  right now right prove the concept show  that it works  and then you can slowly expand and see  if like the home depot guy is even going  to pay you for this  if you go out you talk about marketing  this concept if you go out and  you get some people a job they're going  to spread the word for you  right so in my city toronto i have  we have a large filipina community and  a lot of them are nannies and  we had a nanny for a while and when  there are jobs  they talk to each other there's a whole  community right there's a lot of  filipinos here they love to share  and a lot of the jobs that that are on  the market they never even get posted  because they share and talk to each  other  so if you get a few people in and you  get them a job through a relationship  that you have  they're gonna share they're gonna spread  that word for you and say  yeah messages scott email this guy call  this guy and get added to his list  and every time he has a job he's going  to send you a message  so start small start local prove the  concept  make your mistakes without spending a  lot of money  and then invest in expanding this thing  once you prove it in your local area  to go national and take over the world  because that's how jerry does  believe those are watching like the  video support me by clicking on the link  in the description  leave a comment let me know what you  think and click on my face subscribe to  the channel thank you so much  i'll see you soon

